# Laptop-only packages (machine = laptop).

## Power management + battery
power-profiles-daemon
upower
acpi

# brightnessctl lives in core.list — the laptop backlight binds need it, but
# listing it twice only makes the pacman command line noisier.

## Wifi
networkmanager
iwd

## Touchpad gesture support is in-compositor (hl.gesture), nothing to install.

## rkvm client — receive keyboard/mouse from the desktop
aur:rkvm
